{"title":"INDOOR SOCCER TORONTO","startsAt":"2026-11-05T21:30:00-05:00","endsAt":"2026-11-05T23:30:00-05:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"**🚨IMPORTANT UPDATE - READ BEFORE RSVPing🚨**\n\nWe’ve launched our new website: www.soccertoronto.ca **All sign‑ups must now be completed through the website.** Meetup reservations **do NOT** confirm your spot.\nThere is **no texting or emailing to sign up anymore.** All program information, registration, rules, and updates are now on the website.\n**Do NOT show up without signing up in advance — you will be turned away.**\n\n**HOW TO SIGN UP**\n👉 Register online at www.soccertoronto.ca\n👉 Payments must be sent to payment@soccertoronto.ca\n👉 For general questions only, email info@soccertoronto.ca\n\n**TORONTO’S BEST INDOOR PICKUP SOCCER**\nHosted by **Soccer Toronto** — Est. 2008\n\n**SPRING/SUMMER SCHEDULE**\n\n* **Mondays** — 9:30 to 11:30 PM\n* **Thursdays** — 9:30 to 11:30 PM\n\nPickup soccer runs weekly at the newly renovated **Metro Golf Sportsplex**, **125 Milner Avenue (McCowan & 401)**.\nWe welcome skilled regulars and new players every week. There is always a game.\n\n**PROGRAM DETAILS**\n\n* **Format:** 7v7 or 8v8\n* **Level:** All players welcome (Beginner to Advanced)\n* **Cost:** **$20/player** — *payment required in advance*\n* **Payment Email:** payments@soccertoronto.ca\n* **Full Info:** www.soccertoronto.ca\n\n**WHAT TO BRING**\n\n* Indoor turf shoes (no cleats)\n* Shin guards recommended\n* Water\n* Jerseys/pinnies/balls are provided\n* Snacks & drinks available on-site\n\nMeet the organizer on the first field when you enter the facility.\n\n**REMINDER**\n\n**Meetup RSVP = NOT a confirmed spot.** Only website registrations count.\nSpace is limited — register early.","venue":{"name":"Metro Golf Sportsplex","address":"125 Milner Ave, Scarborough","lat":43.78474,"lng":-79.24643,"city":"Scarborough"},"fee":null,"group":"Toronto Soccer Meetup","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/9/8/2/d/highres_528578957.jpeg"}